---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — Delta Force Hawk Ops Guide"
  description="Privacy policy for game-delta.asia. Learn how we collect, use, and protect your data."
  canonical="https://game-delta.asia/privacy-policy/"
  currentPage="privacy"
>
  <main class="article-page">
    <div class="container">
      <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span class="breadcrumb-sep">›</span>
        <span>Privacy Policy</span>
      </nav>

      <div class="article-content">
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p><em>Last updated: August 7, 2026</em></p>

        <p>This Privacy Policy describes how Delta Force Hawk Ops Guide ("we", "us", "our") collects, uses, and protects information when you visit our website game-delta.asia.</p>

        <h2 id="information-we-collect">Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>We collect minimal information necessary to operate and improve our website:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Google Analytics:</strong> We use Google Analytics to understand how visitors interact with our site. This includes pages visited, time spent, and referral sources. Data is anonymized.</li>
          <li><strong>Google AdSense:</strong> We display ads through Google AdSense. Google may use cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to our site and other sites on the Internet.</li>
          <li><strong>Contact Form:</strong> If you contact us via email, we collect the information you voluntarily provide (name, email address, message content).</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 id="cookies">Cookies</h2>
        <p>We use cookies for:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Essential:</strong> Cookie consent preferences (stored locally in your browser)</li>
          <li><strong>Analytics:</strong> Google Analytics tracking cookies</li>
          <li><strong>Advertising:</strong> Google AdSense advertising cookies (only after consent)</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 id="how-we-use">How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>To improve our website and guides</li>
          <li>To respond to your inquiries</li>
          <li>To serve relevant advertisements (with your consent)</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 id="third-parties">Third Parties</h2>
        <p>We share data with: Google (Analytics and AdSense). These third parties have their own privacy policies governing their use of data.</p>

        <h2 id="your-rights">Your Rights</h2>
        <p>Under GDPR and applicable privacy laws, you have the right to: access, correct, or delete your personal data; opt out of data collection; and withdraw consent at any time.</p>

        <h2 id="contact-privacy">Contact</h2>
        <p>For privacy-related inquiries, contact us at <strong>ben357753@163.com</strong>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
